<title>USA: Service merchandise senior notes cut.</title>
<headline>Service merchandise senior notes cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Wednesday it has downgraded Service Merchandise Company Inc's $100 million of senior unsecured notes to double-B-minus from double-B.</p>
<p>The rating agency also said it lowered $300 million of senior subordinated debentures to single-B from double-B-minus.</p>
</text>
